---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8 prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert">
    <h1>About DocPrep</h1>
    <p>DocPrep is a comprehensive Previous Year Question (PYQ) bank designed specifically for AIIMS Patna MBBS students.</p>
    <p>Our goal is to provide a reliable, easy-to-use platform for students to access, search, and study past exam questions, complete with peer-reviewed answers.</p>
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>To organize medical knowledge and make it universally accessible and useful for AIIMS Patna students, fostering a collaborative learning environment.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
